    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "6a0f1878d5d2918e307a": "You learn quickly, that is not a bad thing. Just be sure to do the job right, as long as it takes to do so. Now, I fear I must send you to Snarl to learn more. Learn what he can teach, but do not listen to his angry words. He gets that way when Saru's daughters laugh at him."
      },
      "name": "Gur'dok",
      "subName": "Journeyman Blacksmith",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
